WEBVTT

00:18:29.655 --> 00:18:31.625
seremos capazes de dizer:

00:18:31.839 --> 00:18:33.446
"Nós conseguimos.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.750
"E depois dançámos."

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.863
(Vídeo)

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.170
(Música)

00:18:44.797 --> 00:18:46.480
SG: Obrigada.

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:49.566
(Aplausos)

00:18:51.758 --> 00:18:53.106
MP: Obrigado.

00:18:53.191 --> 00:18:56.134
(Aplausos)